### Mobile App Implementation

#### 1. **Project Structure**
```
mobile/src/
├── components/      # Reusable UI components
├── screens/         # App screens (auth, booking, owner)
├── services/        # API integration layer
├── store/           # Redux Toolkit state management
├── utils/           # Constants, helpers, formatters
└── App.js           # Navigation & app setup
```

#### 2. **Navigation Architecture** - [App.js](file:///C:/Users/DELL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/parking-rental-app/mobile/src/App.js)
Three-tier navigation:
- **Auth Navigator**: Login, Signup
- **Tab Navigator**: Home, Map, Bookings, Dashboard (owners), Profile
- **Stack Navigator**: Detail screens, modals

**Role-based UI**: Dashboard tab only visible for OWNER role users

