## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Backend Setup
```bash
cd backend
npm install
cp .env.example .env
# Configure .env with database credentials
mysql -u root -p parking_rental < database/schema-standard.sql
npm run dev
```

### 2. Mobile Setup
```bash
cd mobile
npm install
cp .env.example .env
# Configure .env with API URL and map keys
npm run android  # or npm run ios
```

